flowchart TB
  event[mandate.created 或资料版本事件] --> inbox[持久 outbox / inbox]
  inbox --> route[有效依赖匹配与业务 job]
  route --> exec[execution / attempt / lease]
  exec --> dsh[有界 DSH 研究与证据]
  dsh --> admit[主体 / 期间 / 指标 / attempt 准入]
  admit --> baseline[基准或后续复核结果]
  baseline --> condition[met / unmet / unknown / error]
  condition --> decide[委托核心：联系资格与决定]
  decide --> queue[通知：渠道 / 静默 / 队列 / 重试]
  queue --> gate[发送前事务复核授权与代次]
  gate --> receipt[投递回执 / unknown 对账]
